# kind          mechanism | checkpoint | tradeoff | warning. optional.
# status        draft | reviewed | published. recommend drafts are draft.
# source        where it came from. url if you have one.
# confidence    0-1 gut check. new drafts stay low.
# refines       other card ids this sharpens. not a paragraph.
# contradicts   other card ids this fights. not a paragraph.
